Third-party notices

This mod contains no vendored third-party code: it is a single client.mjs entry
with no dependencies and no imports.

Parts of it are adapted from the following MIT-licensed projects:

  1. wittyfunn/lyric-ai-director-plus
     https://github.com/wittyfunn/lyric-ai-director-plus
     Copyright (c) 2026 wittyfunn, released under the MIT License.
     Adapted: the pattern of the per-mode parameter whitelist and gating table
     (MODE_PARAMS / PARAM_GATES), and the way the chat-completions endpoint URL
     is derived from a provider base URL.

  2. duoduo1232/lyric-ai-director
     https://github.com/duoduo1232/lyric-ai-director
     Copyright (c) 2026 duoduo1232, released under the MIT License.
     (Upstream of project 1; the tables above originate here.)

The lyric-animation mode profiles, the segmentation prompt, the scheduling and
switching logic, the panel and the rest of the mod are original work released
under the same MIT terms.
